---
source: crates/news/tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout_of(&[\"--help\"])"
---
News agent toolbox

Usage: news <COMMAND>

Commands:
  version  Print the CLI version as JSON
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
